body='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Quiet Magnet — Final Gen 3 comparison</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#111419;color:#eceae5;font:14px/1.5 system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif}header,section,nav{max-width:1480px;margin:auto;padding:12px 18px}header{border-bottom:1px solid #353a43}h1{font:600 25px Georgia,serif;margin:3px 0}h2{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 7px}p{margin:6px 0;color:#c2beb6}a{color:#9cdbc9}button,select{font:inherit;color:inherit;border:1px solid #52605f;background:#232a30;min-height:34px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}button[aria-pressed=true]{color:#13241f;background:#9cdbc9}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #f6ce77;outline-offset:2px}nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px}.badge{font-size:12px;color:#f4cb74}.panels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #353a43}details{border-top:1px solid #353a43;padding-top:8px;margin-top:8px}summary{cursor:pointer;color:#9cdbc9;min-height:30px}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font:13px/1.6 system-ui}.frame-wrap{padding:0 10px 18px;overflow:auto;display:flex;justify-content:center}iframe{box-sizing:content-box;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid #52605f;background:#17181b;width:1440px;height:900px}.help{max-width:1480px;margin:auto;font-size:12px;padding:0 18px 10px}#open{margin-left:auto}@media(max-width:780px){.panels{grid-template-columns:1fr}header,section,nav{padding:10px}.frame-wrap{justify-content:flex-start}table{font-size:12px}td,th{padding:4px}#open{margin-left:0}}
</style><header><span class="badge">FINAL GENERATION · STATIC DESIGN EVIDENCE</span><h1>Quiet Magnet: two ways to stay small</h1><p>G3A keeps both collected kinds in view. G3B indexes them into a smaller card. Author verification; independent final review remains the next stage.</p></header><section class="panels"><div><h2>Measured at 390 × 844</h2><table><tr><th>Candidate</th><th>Card area</th><th>Deep full items</th><th>Audit facts</th></tr>__ROWS__</table><p>G3A misses the strict 25% card target. G3B adds one selection to see Files. Two full evidence rows now appear on deep arrival in both.</p></div><div><h2>Derivation map</h2><table><tr><th>Historical ancestry</th><th>Selected parent</th><th>Final derivative</th></tr><tr><td>C6 × C4 × C5</td><td>G2A-c · best Gen 2</td><td>→ G3A only</td></tr><tr><td>C4 × C6 × C5</td><td>G2B-c</td><td>→ G3B only</td></tr></table><p>Compact intent already entered both parents through owner clarification ent-93f00e5ef142 and its screenshots. G2C-c is excluded; none of its distinctive patterns was harvested. C4 and C1 remain frozen comparison yardsticks.</p></div></section><section><details><summary>Review guide, tradeoffs and evidence</summary><p>Start at Rest. Hover, Tab to the object, or tap it for the quick card. Use its own Open evidence or Magnet Chat controls for the scenario. In deep work at 390px use Inquiry &amp; Chat to reach P1/P2/P3, questions, synthesis, continuation and the separate Conversation. Return to Origin #14 restores the immutable draft preview and destination.</p><p>Static study illustrates three coordinates. No dragging, persistence, backend enforcement, creating, sending or dispatch occurs. The card kind switch and deep navigation are local static presentation only.</p><p>C4 is the strongest Gen 1 deep surface; C1 is the conventional inspector. Both predate the compact clarification and arrive deep. Geometry is not user testing. C4 still shows more complete desktop evidence than the finalists.</p>__LOCAL_LINKS__<details><summary>Full supporting report (embedded)</summary><pre>__REPORT__</pre></details></details></section><nav aria-label="Comparison controls"><label for="pick">Inspect </label><select id="pick"><option value="G3A">G3A · Grouped Preview Workbench</option><option value="G3B">G3B · Indexed Preview Split Desk</option><option value="G2A-c">G2A-c · Best Gen 2 (frozen)</option><option value="G2B-c">G2B-c · Other selected parent (frozen)</option><option value="C4">C4 · Frozen Gen 1 deep baseline</option><option value="C1">C1 · Conventional baseline</option></select><button id="desktop" aria-pressed="true">1440 × 900</button><button id="phone" aria-pressed="false">390 × 844</button><button id="reset">Reset document</button><a id="open" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open selected file</a></nav><p class="help" id="caption">Exact comparison viewports require enough window width; smaller windows can scroll the desktop frame. The frame remains the selected pixel size. All candidate controls are inside it.</p><div class="frame-wrap"><iframe id="view" title="Inspectable Quiet Magnet candidate"></iframe></div><script>__SCRIPT__</script></html>'''
